:name: Factory Control Unit (STM32H563)
:description: rtoos firmware on the Factory Control Unit. Set $bin to the ELF to run.

$name?="fcu"
$bin?=@build/arm/apps/fcu_selftest.elf

using sysbus
mach create $name
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/fcu.repl

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
    cpu VectorTableOffset 0x08000000
"""
runMacro $reset
